# Session handoff

At the **start of every new chat**, before planning or editing:

1. Read the **first ~120 lines** of [`HANDOFF.md`](../../HANDOFF.md) at repo root.
2. If doing feature work, read [`.cursor/active-slice`](../../.cursor/active-slice) when it exists.
3. If fixing QA bugs with ClickUp, read [`.cursor/active-defects`](../../.cursor/active-defects) when it exists.
4. Then read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`.cursor/skills/ex-react-core/SKILL.md`](../../.cursor/skills/ex-react-core/SKILL.md).

The **stop hook** refreshes **Last updated** and **Repository state** in `HANDOFF.md` automatically — do not paste full `git status` into HANDOFF during sessions.

Human onboarding: [`docs/developer.md`](../../docs/developer.md).
